OL,3,ACan a US-backed mineral highway bring
OL,4,Apeace and prosperity to DR Congo?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs trains carrying thousands of tonnes
OL,7,Fof copper from the Democratic Republic
OL,8,Fof Congo roar through her community,
OL,9,F20-year-old Manuela Julia is not
OL,10,Fthinking about critical minerals or
OL,11,Fbillion-dollar investments.
OL,13,FShe is thinking about getting around
OL,14,Fmore easily.
OL,16,FThe railway runs through Catumbela,
OL,17,Fnear the Angolan city of Lobito, on the
OL,18,FAtlantic coast.
OL,20,FFor Julia, it has made travelling
OL,21,Fcheaper and more convenient.
